## Anti Pattern

- [ ] **Monolithic workflows**: Everything in one workflow
- [ ] **No error handling**: Silent failures
- [ ] **Hardcoded credentials**: Security risk
- [ ] **No timeout**: Infinite waits
- [ ] **No logging**: No visibility
- [ ] **Tight coupling**: Workflows depend on specific execution order

## Best Practice

- [ ] **Modular design**: Break into reusable sub-workflows
- [ ] **Error workflows**: Attach error handlers
- [ ] **Environment variables**: Store secrets securely
- [ ] **Timeouts**: Set reasonable limits
- [ ] **Comprehensive logging**: Track execution
- [ ] **Idempotency**: Safe to retry

